// Rule: [T1543.003] Head Mare - Phantomgraph Temp Batch Services
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1543.003
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required telemetry: SecurityEvent
// Purpose: Campaign hunt for Windows service installation that launches a temporary command batch through cmd.exe.
// Logic: Evaluate SecurityEvent for phantomgraph temp batch services using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: The host recorded the complete campaign-specific service installation pattern and requires immediate raw-event, file and server review.
// A match does not prove: Service start, batch execution, PhantomGraph DLL loading, TrueConf exploitation, OneDrive C2, LSASS access or Head Mare attribution.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// Head Mare / PhantomGraph Windows service persistence
// Classification: Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Confidence: Medium
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required connector: Windows Security Events via AMA with Event ID 4697
// Source evidence: Kaspersky observed SysExcSvc and SysReadSvc services whose
// service command invokes a %TEMP%\cmd_cmd_*.bat file through cmd /c.
// No threshold, rarity, join, sequence, hash, domain, or attribution is used.

SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4697
| where ServiceName in~ ("SysExcSvc", "SysReadSvc")
| where ServiceFileName contains "cmd"
| where ServiceFileName contains "/c"
| where ServiceFileName contains @"\Temp\"
| where ServiceFileName contains "cmd_cmd_"
| where ServiceFileName contains ".bat"
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    Computer,
    EventID,
    EventRecordId,
    ServiceName,
    ServiceFileName,
    ServiceType,
    ServiceStartType,
    ServiceAccount,
    SubjectUserSid,
    SubjectUserName,
    SubjectDomainName,
    SubjectLogonId,
    Activity,
    EventSourceName,
    _ResourceId
| order by TimeGenerated desc
